{"id":"schlechter","lemma":"schlechter","pos":"adv","rank":1198,"glosses":["worse"],"ipa":"/ˈʃlɛçtɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c8/De-schlechter.ogg/De-schlechter.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Deine ist schlechter.","en":"Yours is worse.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/718185","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Sei kein schlechter Junge.","en":"Don't be a bad boy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/395051","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a"},null,{"g":"boy"}]},{"text":"Welcher ist deiner Meinung nach schlechter?","en":"Which do you think is worse?","words":[{"g":"which"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"yours, thine"},{"g":"opinion"},{"g":"after / to"},null]},{"text":"Nichts kann schlechter sein als das.","en":"Nothing can be worse than that.","words":[{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,{"g":"to be"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"the / that"}]},{"text":"Ihr habt es schlechter als wir.","en":"You guys have it worse than we do.","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"we"}]}]}